  <scopecontent id="183ec5a4cfc64687c9f1ff55e0929d15">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>This series documents the Commonwealth Fund Task Force on Academic Health Centers. The majority of the material is grant administration files pertaining to the Task Force. These records often include documentation of: proposals, administration and budget, grant products, related correspondence and background material. A limited selection of Task Force meeting files is also included.</p>  </scopecontent>
  <acqinfo id="1d32a7782269a9973b10035fdbbbd847">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>The Commonwealth Fund records were donated to RAC in 1985. The initial transfer of archival records to RAC began in 1986, and transfers continue on a regular basis. This series was transferred to RAC as accession 2007:077.</p>  </acqinfo>
